        <li>The builder's code and the JSON Schema: MIT.</li>
        <li>The examples are fictional. Any resemblance to real people, companies or addresses is coincidental.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Taking part</h2>
      <p>
        The format is at version 1.0, and every 1.x version only adds. If you run maintenance, do repairs, or build software for
        either, we would like to see a real (anonymised) completion report and hear what this gets wrong. Write to
        <a href="mailto:support@pmfriend.com">support@pmfriend.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
